t: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">7. R<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px;\">eturn a response directly from their custom code.<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px;\"><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Key Benefits:</b></span></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">This improvement allows for a more streamlined coding experience, making it easier to write, debug, and manage custom asynchronous code.</span></span></span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px;\">This new capability simplifies handling asynchronous operations and improves the overall efficiency of custom scripts.</span></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032371757/original/Ne5QkAhbZq5vcfWYOyaLoGfXS_g3lu-abQc722.png?1725601523\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155032371757\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 363px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Points to Remember</strong></span></span></h1><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Custom value will not be passed when you are testing your code.Only the contact information will be passed when testing a code. Other properties used in the code will not pass while testing.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Testing the code is mandatory. No output will be available for untested code in subsequent action.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Use the Property fields to assign key names and map values from previous steps. Use inputData.keyName or inputData['keyName'] to access the values within the code.</li></ul>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000000174-a2p-10dlc-campaign-approval-best-practices", "title": "A2P 10DLC Campaign Approval Best Practices",