p;</p><hr data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"464\"><h2 data-end=\"492\" data-start=\"466\"><strong data-end=\"492\" data-start=\"471\">File Requirements</strong></h2><ul data-end=\"827\" data-start=\"493\"><li data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"493\"><p data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"495\" dir=\"ltr\">The file must be in .csv format.</p></li><li data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"528\"><p data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"530\">The <strong data-end=\"571\" data-start=\"534\">column headers must exactly match</strong> those provided in the sample file.</p></li><li data-end=\"763\" data-start=\"607\"><p data-end=\"763\" data-start=\"609\" dir=\"ltr\">Each row represents a single order item. If an order contains multiple line items, each line item must be a separate row, with all order-level fields repeated.</p></li><li data-end=\"827\" data-start=\"764\"><p data-end=\"827\" data-start=\"766\">All required fields must be filled in to avoid upload errors.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"832\"><h2 data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"834\"><strong data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"840\">CSV Column Descriptions and Examples</strong></h2><div class=\"pointer-events-none relative left-[50%]! flex w-[100cqw] translate-x-[-50%] justify-center *:pointer-events-auto\"><div class=\"tableContainer horzScrollShadows group relative\"><table class=\"min-w-full\" data-end=\"4054\" data-start=\"882\"><thead data-end=\"1019\" data-start=\"882\"><tr data-end=\"1019\" data-start=\"882\"><th data-end=\"908\" data-start=\"882\"><strong data-end=\"899\" data-start=\"884\">Column Name</strong></th><th data-end=\"990\" data-start=\"908\"><strong data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"910\">Description</strong></th><th data-end=\"1019\" data-start=\"990\"><strong data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"992\">Example</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-end=\"4054\" data-start=\"1158\"><tr data-end=\"1295\" data-start=\"1158\"><td class=\"max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]\" data-end=\"1184\" data-start=\"1158\"